 and i'm prepared  to therefore i have a an open mindset a  growth mindset  but maybe i don't have a growth mindset  when it comes to learning  uh i don't know uh the piano or or  something that i'm not intrinsically  interested in so it does boil down to  the kind of motivation but if a person  is motivated to learn a language then to  say i am not talented i think is not  true  you have to create that talent in you  but the question is are you motivated  and can you find a path a learning path  that will maintain that motivation and  if you can  you can learn  if you have a growth mindset so for  those of you who are interested you can  look at the links that i'm going to put  in the description so there you have it  thanks for listening i hope you all have  a growth mindset  bye for now
 

